  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4864be37a0e0765a0d774c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e618816c98fbf13e2056149ff0efc172ae8ed8969dbd6c7dd364cfc94ba1c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07c57732ca26b8750fa6d29b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果技能点数还有剩余的话，\\n请注意不要忘记使用哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca78c7abc734d745d6907104ad5b26cada0eb67a0067a3c63bdf20d58f805017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b934705355e16fea3d95a72f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "执行1个命令，\\n将耗费回合数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68813f12c31e59c71e67dc816ba2140e291f81a04a8cbcad38330954b5e9cb6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2219cce198429da3dff073da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，育成就结束了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a6a751873a5d1712c5ac9737584c6b4b2c79750018c1821f7b2e20f8d3dc81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653b385e2e5b9604a195fa8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成结束的赛马娘，在按一定标准得到评价后\\n将登记为『殿堂赛马娘』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc153001438f2d15dccfac12bf740f533462fed07e6bc4a35b4494c6aa3aae7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e08e73b6923f23991e6db54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向着最高等级的评价努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7dbdb5d79a1e84cb8d2a5f1b405d151c6053c296d0ed8194d070c4337a9a8d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "32"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b06ec33c25113098553291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成结束的赛马娘\\n可获得『因子』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a83af9a9cd9813e90e13ff74bb79346ff1cae5f45488cb02f3005f775b0ffb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4c0a22d010c2eda53d96ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过将其选择为继承赛马娘，可与新赛马娘的心意相连，\\n将她的『因子』继承下去哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca29d485ac278a67e1087c43d406200a2b1bb6ac43b5dd94ff467a94e2635700",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934ab5d8fc75ddd3bd59d6e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "恭喜获得第1名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "577d728ab25612b15b3cf10b2fe70507bd037c2f9ec4895f2d871e8d7dd648e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1d325ecc63af830d7fbef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请好好夸奖一下\\n努力拼搏了的赛马娘哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fb19c321f4dbdeccfe382db22659e33e25405f9727de9b1c6e4fe78eb69a0e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0db89e2ac3be054ccef9ab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本比赛后会举行胜者舞台，\\n但由于本次是实习，就请允许我们省略一下哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0d0e3faad160ed7ea17c137f6ecee143da2d4f757409b7931c4ed0ae10c872",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac368ac1a9ec1e76aed7647a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "点击这里将结束育成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de266824b72e73be74021e536ecf4550bdc3ef64af0d7efe2ab51409b35e1a5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4983e0e7e384cab655ea83ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "另外，虽然此次实习很短暂，\\n但原本的育成为『3年』期限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "021f0f61087df1fd705dd088af20055d141e14bfc87dca42ba70d23082eb6a85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b4956f45a103f0ebe63c7fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先试着选择『训练』命令吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7df472cb927db6ac24538b82495c2b41b3ac73d0bd311db36536db1ce290635",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab513c8d6d0e9e5fe9972ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您与赛马娘的日常，\\n请好好珍视哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4923572dc7dd9b0e1276d333e51c319bdc7c95f92c22a04d30adb1df6b12a3c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa71b1f89c54db48fc1101e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这三个印章代表了专家们的预测，\\n人气则代表粉丝们的预测。",
      "source_fingerprint": "691f68643cf126cb8dffb47f216a14872d01dc084bf3a8fe9fa667473eb11616",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7afb619850b3216202f0c120",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这些是训练的种类！\\n每一项训练提升的能力各不相同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a33c033c8b4418be3aa5832a3839d89ead799ed54f80010c5768b9faaebdb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a43d845d52650320013c28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尝试选择一下『速度』吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31137a858f586f7fa6238b4ff7ef89784d5e50c474045d121ba4e26c04cf9417",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c520085e5f6da65bd04020c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "接下来，我会说明一下\\n育成赛马娘体力的相关内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c74988ded2455baa2f191e1afb319f11c92a9aefe0c8ef81327f39de00b540a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:521b3a10815b5314f6b8d6ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先和刚才一样，\\n选择训练命令吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25bf8ece4ea1d276f5616b62345aed05e947001ece42e869d0b7aacb46f45518",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34218e1e61b97efdb1fbe59f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请注意这里的『失败率』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4577d9b7a3bc1550d54de848c98fcb14ef3343e29930dc28f401801b29dfe278",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3",
        "9"
      ]
    },
